  "goodToKnow": "Rangieren means to shunt or manoeuvre trains and vehicles: Güterwagen rangieren, mit dem Auto rangieren (to manoeuvre into a tight spot). It also means to rank: auf Platz drei rangieren, ganz oben rangieren. Der Rangierbahnhof is a marshalling yard; Maschen near Hamburg is one of Europe's largest. The g is pronounced as in French. Perfect: hat rangiert."
